    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Five bedroom dormer residence nestling into a private site of  C. 0.75 Acres, located at Coolfore on the N2,  the residence is not overlooked to the front or rear.\r\nThe property is good condition throughout, and offers spacious living accommodation. There are also a secure concrete yard and workshop with electric roller doors,  along with a large store to the rear. \r\n\r\n\r\nWithin 5-minute drive to the M2 motorway which in turn give access to the M50 and Dublin City, 20 minute drive to Dublin Airport.\r\n\r\n Within close proximity of the M2/M50, as well as Bus Eireann Services. There are a host of other amenities that include a variety of supermarkets, shops, schools, parks and sporting facilities a short drive.   Other local recreational amenities of Golf Clubs, GAA Clubs, Rugby clubs, the Fairyhouse Racecourse, the Hill of Tara, and Emerald Park."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Front porch                                                          6.35 m x 1.00m\r\nTiled floor.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall                                                       6.65m x1.40m\r\nWood panelling to wall, carpet to floor.\r\nStairs to 1st floor.\r\n                                                                                                                                     \r\n                                              \r\nReception Room                                                  4.90m x 4.20m                                       \r\nFireplace (cast iron set, walnut surround)\r\nFitted display unit, carpet to floor.\r\n                                                                                                       \r\nKitchen/dining area                                             6.50m x 4.40m                                                                \r\nWall & floor units, fireplace (wood burning stove)\r\nOven, hob, dishwasher, lino to floor.                                                                                                                             \r\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       \r\nUtility Room                                                      3.20m x 1.45m\r\nTiled floor, door to rear.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1                                                        3.90m x 3.20m                                                     \r\nFitted wardrobes, carpet to floor.\r\n          \r\nBedroom 2/study                                              3.00m x 2.60m                                                   \r\nLino to floor.\r\nBedroom 3                                                         3.95m x 2.41m                                                       \r\nLino to floor.\r\n\r\n1st Floor: \r\n\r\nBedroom 4                                                          4.40m x 3.65m                                                 \r\nLino to floor.\r\nEn-suite                                                              1.95m x 1.40m                                                         \r\nShower ,WC, WHB.\r\nWalk -in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 5                                                         3.65m x 3.20m\r\nFitted wardrobes, carpet to floor.    \r\nBathroom                                                           2.50m x 2.20m\r\nShower , wc, whb, tiled floor, partly tiled walls.\r\n\r\n\r\nOutside:                                                                                                   \r\n•\tTarmac/concrete/stone /driveway.\r\n•\tParking to front & rear.\r\n•\tLawn to front side and rear. \r\n•\tWorkshop 1 (display shelving)                7.00m x 7.00m\r\n•\tWorkshop 2 (concrete floor)                   14.50m x 5.30m\r\n•\tWc\r\n•\tBoiler house\r\n•\tStore \r\n•\t2 x bedroom garden house (patio area)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nServices:\r\n\r\nE.S.B. (Smart Meter).\r\nOil Central Heating.\r\nPrivate well , Septic tank, Security Alarm & lights."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
